# Keep the build context small + reproducible. The Rust build needs src/, data/
# (CSV tables are include_str!'d at compile time), Cargo.*, tools/, and the
# repos/ submodules — but never build artifacts, the python ref env, or any
# already-fetched bundle/results.
.git
.github
.refenv
target
**/target
pypgx-bundle
/pypgx-bundle
rust-bundle
results
*.log
